The Aurelius system is a gravitationally bound star system consisting of the star Aurelius and the objects that orbit it. The system is composed of twelve major planets, numerous moons, and various smaller bodies including asteroids and cometary debris. It is organized into three distinct regions: the Inner Terrestrial Zone, the Giant Realm, and the Outer Frontier.

The system architecture is unique for the presence of a Hot Jupiter, [[Quetzal]], located within the inner reaches, which exerts profound gravitational influence over the terrestrial worlds. The primary habitable world, [[Adonia]], serves as the cultural and biological baseline for the system. Astronomical study of the system has evolved through three distinct eras of discovery, beginning with ancient Sinopian and Sanese observations and culminating in the telescopic discoveries of the outer ice giants in the 18th and 19th centuries.

==Structure and Composition==

The Aurelius system is characterized by a high degree of orbital stability despite the presence of high-mass bodies in close proximity to the terrestrial zone. The planets are categorized by their physical composition and distance from the central star.

===Inner Terrestrial Zone===

The inner system consists of the first seven planets, four of which are rocky terrestrial bodies and one of which is a high-mass gas giant. 

* ☿ [[Tartessos]] (Shakugansei): A sun-scorched, airless cinder located at 0.22 AU.
* ♀ [[Ciguapa]] (Kirigoromosei): A super-greenhouse world with retrograde rotation at 0.45 AU.
* ♇ [[Mictlán]] (Yomisei): A tidally locked furnace planet featuring magma oceans at 0.62 AU.
* ♃ [[Quetzal]] (Ryūbisei): A massive gas giant with a hydrogen tail located at 0.85 AU.
* ⱷ [[Adonia]] (Shintensei): The life-bearing turquoise jewel at 1.00 AU.
* ♂ [[Aztlán]] (Hikyōsei): An arid, canyon-scarred world at 1.55 AU.
* ⚶ [[Cíbola]] (Usuraisei): A frozen desert planet at the edge of the habitable zone at 2.10 AU.

===Giant Realm===

Beyond the frost line lies the realm of the giants, consisting of two gas giants and two ice giants. These planets contain the vast majority of the system's planetary mass.

* ♄ [[Amatista]] (Shiunsei): A violet gas giant with a charcoal-grey ring system at 5.40 AU.
* ♅ [[Alcázar]] (Shatensei): The most massive planet in the system, featuring a 98-degree axial tilt at 11.20 AU.
* ♆ [[Lucero]] (Byakuyasei): A luminous, featureless white ice giant at 22.80 AU.
* ⛢ [[Centinela]] (Morobitosei): A cobalt-blue ice giant with sharp water-ice rings at 35.40 AU.

===Outer Frontier===

The far reaches of the system are dominated by small, icy bodies and the outlier planet [[Erebo]].

* ⚷ [[Erebo]] (Tokoyamisei): A dark, frozen dwarf planet at 52.00 AU, marking the transition to the interstellar void.

